    354 U00bc		       00 14	   JET_MAX    =	$14	; max jet thrust accumulator = 20. With the
    355 U00bc							; ÷4 ramp gate below: full thrust at 80f,
    356 U00bc							; net lift (vy=0) at exactly 60f = 1.0s
