    871  f121							; Object off: ObjBase=$FF sentinel (ObjTop parked 144). S2.2: ObjTop is RoomY-relative;
    872  f121							; Y here = A0+1 = next line's A0, so `Y - ObjTopRel` = Scanline - ObjTop
    873  f121							; (mod 256, exact). In-object iff result 0..7 → `cmp #8/bcs` (C=0 in
