   1077  f1f7							; Vertical movement — HERO-style jetpack physics
   1078  f1f7							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1079  f1f7							; Gravity pulls down, holding Up fires jetpack (JetPower ramps with inertia).
   1080  f1f7							; Velocity is integrated through PlayerYSub and walked pixel-by-pixel via
   1081  f1f7							; StepDown/StepUp so collision stops flush at walls/doorways.
   1082  f1f7							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   1083  f1f7				   UpdateP0Vertical
   1084  f1f7							; --- Clear HotBump (Temp b7) — set again only if this frame bumps hot rock ---
