   2335  f806							; Frame A = normal, frame B = jet legs (rows 7-8 differ; 3 pixels changed).
   2336  f806							; Per-row colors in PlayerColTable (RED/RED/YELLOW/RED/GRAY/RED/.../BLACK/BLACK).
