   2338  f806							; CEH_Key — type-6 key pickup (docs/feature_tiles_plan.md Phase 5): latch
   2339  f806							; KeyHeld ($A7 b7) and mark the key slot dead so it vanishes, with NO life
   2340  f806							; loss. X = EnemyIndex (set by CheckEnemyHit's hit path); reached via
   2341  f806							; `jmp CEH_Key` from that dispatch. Lives in the $F82C pre-pad pin gap
   2342  f806							; (177B slack before the $F8DD sprite pin); pre-pad END headroom is 1B but
   2343  f806							; this region is upstream of the pin, so it costs nothing at $FC67.
   2344  f806							; KEY is one per level, so KeyHeld is a single bit (no per-key storage).
   2345  f806							; LevelStartRoom b7 resets when LoadLevel rewrites $A7 (:1875) before its own
   2346  f806							; read at :1922, so no reader mask is needed; KeyHeld survives room changes
   2347  f806							; and normal deaths, resets on game-over reload.
   2348  f806							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   2349  f806				   CEH_Key
   2350  f806		       a5 ba		      lda	EnemyDeadMask
   2351  f808		       1d b2 f3 	      ora	EnemyBitTable,X
   2352  f80b		       85 ba		      sta	EnemyDeadMask
   2353  f80d		       a5 a7		      lda	LevelStartRoom
   2354  f80f		       09 80		      ora	#$80	; KeyHeld = b7
   2355  f811		       85 a7		      sta	LevelStartRoom
   2356  f813		       60		      rts
