   3091  fd37							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3092  fd37							; TitleWork — merged title/level-select screen (DropTarget = $FD sentinel,
   3093  fd37							; dispatched from DropStep every frame). The TitleKernel shows the logo, the
   3094  fd37							; selected level number (digits band) and the credits; the theme plays here.
   3095  fd37							; No gravity/enemies/sound beyond the music (frame is title-owned; timer
   3096  fd37							; frozen). SELECT cycles Level, RESET starts the game at the selected level.
   3097  fd37							;   SELECT (SWCHB b1, active-low EDGE) → jsr TitleSelect (fill): level+1,
   3098  fd37							;	    wrap → 000001, reload room 0 (swallow removed 2026-10-07, 8b —
   3099  fd37							;	    the intro exit ate the first press and made #2 read as dead)
   3100  fd37							;   RESET  (SWCHB b0, active-low EDGE) → score 000000, LoadLevel tail arms
   3101  fd37							;	    the real drop-in → gameplay starts
   3102  fd37							; ($FD reaches here directly — merged title, 2026-10-19.)
   3103  fd37							; StepsLeft = previous SWCHB sample (physics is skipped on title, so it is
   3104  fd37							; title-owned; the first play frame rewrites it as the step budget).
   3105  fd37							; Console switches are read again after any jsr (LoadLevel clobbers X/Y/A).
   3106  fd37							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3107  fd37				   TitleWork
   3108  fd37							; --- SELECT edge (TitleSelect, fill region) ---
   3109  fd37		       20 4f fc 	      jsr	CallPad_TitleSelect
   3110  fd3a		       90 03		      bcc	.TWselDone	; C=0: no edge
   3111  fd3c		       20 35 f5 	      jsr	LoadLevel	; preview + HUD score follow the selected level
   3112  fd3f				   .TWselDone
   3113  fd3f							; --- RESET edge ---
   3114  fd3f		       a5 97		      lda	StepsLeft
   3115  fd41		       29 01		      and	#%00000001
   3116  fd43		       f0 14		      beq	.TWrstDone
   3117  fd45		       ad 82 02 	      lda	SWCHB
   3118  fd48		       29 01		      and	#%00000001
   3119  fd4a		       d0 0d		      bne	.TWrstDone
   3120  fd4c		       a9 00		      lda	#0
   3121  fd4e		       85 8a		      sta	DropTarget	; leave title → LoadLevel tail arms real fall
   3122  fd50		       85 f3		      sta	ScoreTh	; gameplay score starts at 000000
   3123  fd52		       85 f4		      sta	ScoreHu
   3124  fd54		       85 f5		      sta	ScoreTe
   3125  fd56		       20 35 f5 	      jsr	LoadLevel
