   3204  fda8							; BuildColupF — 12-byte final COLUPF image at ColupfBuf ($E7-$F2).
   3205  fda8							;   Stripe: rows 0,2 = LevelWallColor; row 1 = LevelWallColor2.
   3206  fda8							;   Hot rows overwrite with TickCounter-bit4 pulse (COLOR_HOT_Y/R).
   3207  fda8							;   $F0-$F2 (bombs) NO LONGER overlap-saved: body writes rows 0-2 only,
   3208  fda8							;   save/restore round trip deleted (S3.0b — window audit: zero writers).
   3209  fda8							;   Bank1 clobbers $E0-$EF during HUD; VBLANK rebuilds every frame.
   3210  fda8							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3211  fda8							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3212  fda8							; BuildColupF — MOVED to bank2 (S5.1) — CallPad_BuildColupF.
   3213  fda8							;   Hot-rect data (RoomRects) lives in bank2, so the body reads it with
   3214  fda8							;   direct (FetchPtr),Y — the shared $FEF6 fold block's sta $1FF6 always
   3215  fda8							;   returns to bank0, so a fold inside a bank1 body could not work.
   3216  fda8							;   The dark check is inlined there too: CallPad_IsRoomDark cannot nest
   3217  fda8							;   from a pad body (ReturnPad switches to bank0 mid-call).
   3218  fda8							;   Body: bank2.asm, pinned at $FC4F. Entry save block ($F0-$F2 → collision
   3219  fda8							;   temps) was dead (rows 0-2 only) — deleted with the .AfterRows restore
   3220  fda8							;   in S3.0b.
   3221  fda8							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3222  fda8
   3223  fda8							; UpdateBombSound moved to bank1 (leaf_move_plan batch A) — CallPad_UpdateBombSound.
