   3269  fdde							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3270  fdde							; PickPlayerFrame — VBL entry tramp: the VBL `jsr` lands here (bank0), `sta
   3271  fdde							; $1FF8` switches to bank2, the `jmp` is fetched from bank2's byte-identical
   3272  fdde							; mirror at this same address and lands on bank2's body ($F3C4). The body
   3273  fdde							; tail-jmps ReturnPad ($FBF8) -> `sta $1FF6/rts` returns to the VBL jsr
   3274  fdde							; (BuildColupF pad pattern; 0 extra stack depth).
   3275  fdde							; Guards: verify_build check_frame_tramp (byte-identity + operand = bank2
   3276  fdde							; label). Body logic: jet flutter (PlayerSpriteA/B) > walk (PlayerWalkA/B) >
   3277  fdde							; static A; phase EnemyRamP&$08 (walk, 16-frame) / TickCounter&4 (jet).
