   3715  ffe6							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   3716  ffe6							; TallyTramp ($FFE6, byte-identical with bank2 — guard: check_moth_tramp).
   3717  ffe6							; bank0 jsr's here (CheckMinerPickup arm / TallyWork step): `sta $1FF8`
   3718  ffe6							; selects bank2, then the jmp operand is fetched from bank2's image at the
   3719  ffe6							; same PC (FoldIndirect discipline). The bank2 body tail-jmps ReturnPad
   3720  ffe6							; ($FBF8) -> rts back to the bank0 jsr. Ends $FFEB — $FFF2-$FFF9 stay fill
   3721  ffe6							; (F6 hotspot mirrors).
